  "featurePage.languages.oneLine": "FieldQuo is built around six languages, and a document keeps the language it was created in.",
  "featurePage.languages.description": "Six languages: quote and invoice copy in English, French, Spanish, Ukrainian, Punjabi and Tagalog, with each document fixed in the language it was written in.",
  "featurePage.languages.pain.1.pain": "The client's English is fine for a chat and not fine for a page of scope and payment terms.",
