  "featurePage.fieldquo-ai.how.3.body": "Every AI request is counted against your account, so the cost of it is a number you can see rather than a surprise.",
  "featurePage.fieldquo-ai.detail.1.label": "Nine things it can look up, and none of them change anything",
  "featurePage.fieldquo-ai.detail.1.body": "Conversion rate, top clients, cash flow, profit by category, repeat-customer rate, upcoming work, and finding a quote, an invoice or a job. There is nothing that creates, edits or sends.",
