  "featurePage.fieldquo-ai.detail.5.body": "Coding, recipes, essays, homework, general knowledge — declined, with what it can help with instead. And where there is no way for it to look something up it says so, rather than working it out from something adjacent.",
  "featurePage.fieldquo-ai.detail.6.label": "The allowance is checked before the question is asked",
  "featurePage.fieldquo-ai.detail.6.body": "And the screen warns you at eighty per cent, rather than at the wall.",

